1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,730
Assam already floods every single year.

2
00:00:02,775 --> 00:00:04,065
Now add a dam upstream.

3
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:07,500
A big dam stores water
and releases it later.

4
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,750
In the dry season, less may arrive.

5
00:00:10,005 --> 00:00:12,795
Farms, fisheries and
river ports feel it first.

6
00:00:12,985 --> 00:00:13,835
In the monsoon,

7
00:00:14,145 --> 00:00:18,735
a sudden release of stored water could
add a flood surge on top of normal rain.

8
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:22,210
That is why India wants early
warning and data from China.

9
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,210
Without it, officials are guessing.

10
00:00:24,455 --> 00:00:27,805
The risk is less about "cutting
off" and more about timing.

11
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:30,070
Part 3: how India could respond.

12
00:00:30,415 --> 00:00:31,585
What would you do first?

13
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:32,470
Comment.

